.TH start-cli-server-registry-signing 1  "registry-signing "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-server\-registry\-signing \- Commands to choose which registries receive signed requests
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli server registry\-signing\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Commands to choose which registries receive signed requests
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
start\-cli\-server\-registry\-signing\-add(1)
Sign requests to a registry
.TP
start\-cli\-server\-registry\-signing\-key(1)
Show the key that signs registry requests
.TP
start\-cli\-server\-registry\-signing\-list(1)
List registries that receive signed requests
.TP
start\-cli\-server\-registry\-signing\-remove(1)
Stop signing requests to a registry
